[DE_ENTI_COMMENT[ Incoterms = International Commercial Terms (Lieferbedingungen) 11 Regeln, welche beim internationalen Handel klar definieren, wer für was verantwortlich ist. Für genauere Beschreibung siehe: https://www.tnt.com/express/de_ch/site/how-to/understand-incoterms.html
Bsp: FCA (Free Carrier)
]DE_ENTI_COMMENT] [EN_ENTI_COMMENT[ **Incoterms = International Commercial Terms (Terms of Delivery) 11 rules that clearly define who is responsible for what in international trade For a more detailed description see: https://www.tnt.com/express/de
Example: FCA (Free Carrier)
]EN_ENTI_COMMENT]
